WEBVTT

00:15:58.737 --> 00:16:02.430
And she would say, "Basingstoke, it is!"
And she'd be fine for a little while.

00:16:02.454 --> 00:16:03.459
(Laughter)

00:16:03.483 --> 00:16:06.407
Well, you know, I'm from the Bronx.
I can't say "Basingstoke."

00:16:06.431 --> 00:16:07.444
(Laughter)

00:16:07.468 --> 00:16:08.887
But I had something better.

00:16:09.661 --> 00:16:10.978
And it was very simple.

00:16:11.461 --> 00:16:13.976
It was, "Ah, fuck it!"

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:16.846
(Laughter)

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.862
Much better than "Basingstoke,"

00:16:18.886 --> 00:16:20.781
at least for me.

00:16:20.805 --> 00:16:23.082
And it worked! My God, it worked.

00:16:23.106 --> 00:16:25.490
Every time I would begin
thinking obsessionally --

00:16:25.514 --> 00:16:29.361
again, once more,
after 20 shock treatments --